 The main UI renderer for Codex Circuits. Draws the toolbar, tab bar,
 schematic canvas with demo circuit, sidebar with component list, and
 status bar — all to a framebuffer for GOP display and screenshot.

Section: Demo Circuit Data

 A pre-built demo schematic: STM32 microcontroller with USB connector,
 decoupling caps, crystal oscillator, reset circuit, and LED indicators.
 Placed at screen coordinates for visual impact.

  DemoComponent = record {
    dc-ref : Text,
    dc-value : Text,
    dc-x : Integer,
    dc-y : Integer,
    dc-w : Integer,
    dc-h : Integer,
    dc-pins : Integer
  }

  DemoWire = record {
    dw-x1 : Integer,
    dw-y1 : Integer,
    dw-x2 : Integer,
    dw-y2 : Integer
  }

  DemoLabel = record {
    dlb-text : Text,
    dlb-x : Integer,
    dlb-y : Integer
  }

